+        // CLASSIFIED patch: prove on a wasm_thread worker, like `sync` does. The Sapling
+        // prover (bellman `multicore`) blocks on Atomics.wait while its threads compute,
+        // which browsers forbid on the main thread ("Atomics.wait cannot be called in this
